    "slot_value": "Reuse or cache an intermediate product only when it can be reused without changing the scientific meaning; if the inputs differ in any way that affects the error model, processing stage, or downstream interpretation, regenerate instead of reusing. Full regeneration is appropriate when the change invalidates most earlier work or when the cached material would cost more to manage than to recreate.",
    "operation": "add"
